it-wallet-registry-explorer
===========================

This project is an unofficial, community-oriented explorer for the public
metadata of the Italian IT-Wallet Registry. It is not a Wallet Instance, not a
Credential Issuer, and not an official publication of AgID, IPZS, or the
European Commission.

Registry contents dumped into `cache/` remain metadata published by the National
Trust Anchor. This tool does not store personal data of natural persons.

